Subject: [PATCH] [v2 only] bench: interleave fixed-input native compression
 controls

Schedule threshold0 controls between16/64/256KiB encoder policies on the same native fixture, binaries, committed source and TLS certificate/key. Use independent APFS copies, reject changed resume inputs or incomplete matrices, preserve resource-blocked cells and aggregate actual wire/cache deltas without generating speedup claims.

